{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Last summer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> students attended basketball camp.  Of those attending, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> were boys and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> were girls.  Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students were from Jonas Middle School and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> were from Clay Middle School.  Twenty of the girls were from Jonas Middle School.  How many of the boys were from Clay Middle School?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdc54e6b8a9b98e65040d087677f17c82cf2cf6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 32 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 40 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Make a table with the information given.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4eac8423a86a41425df1c3d6f3d1b8dc5dcfc034.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{c|ccc} &amp; \\text{Jonas} &amp; \\text{Clay} &amp; \\text{total} \\\\ \\hline \\text{boys} &amp; &amp; &amp; 52 \\\\ \\text{girls} &amp; 20 &amp; &amp; 48 \\\\ \\text{total} &amp; 40 &amp; 60 &amp; 100  \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"222\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>Because the first two columns must add up to the third column, and the same with the rows, the rest of the empty boxes can be filled in.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0fe33721b6b6ffaedcdb960dcd634a5c3100a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{c|ccc} &amp; \\text{Jonas} &amp; \\text{Clay} &amp; \\text{total} \\\\ \\hline \\text{boys} &amp; 20 &amp; 32 &amp; 52 \\\\ \\text{girls} &amp; 20 &amp; 28 &amp; 48 \\\\ \\text{total} &amp; 40 &amp; 60 &amp; 100  \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"222\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>The number of boys from Clay is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776f6cbb7c6f61ded5bf23ab0d171fe672a0a5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\